<title>UGANDA: South African leader in Uganda for one-day visit.</title>
<headline>South African leader in Uganda for one-day visit.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African President Nelson Mandela arrived in Uganda on Wednesday to attend celebrations to mark the country's 34th anniversary of independence from Britain.</p>
<p>Mandela, 78, was welcomed by President Yoweri Museveni at Entebbe airport and driven to the capital for private talks. The South African leader was scheduled to leave Uganda later on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
